            "review_text": "spktravels\nTallman, New York360 contributions\n0\nGreat Chinese cuisine\nMar 2020 • Family\nIt had been over 2 months since my last review and now Golden Jade gets a 5. \n\nThey are being very careful with the Covid virus. As soon as we sat down they brought over hand sanitizer. Then they took all of the plates and utensils and washed them at our table in boiling water.\n\nMonica our server was fantastic. We ordered tea and twice she brought us fresh pots and she kept on cleaning all of our dirty dishes from the table.\n\nWe had calamari, crab sweet-and-sour soup as examples of the delicious food. \n\nThe owner is always there keeping his eyes on everything to make sure all goes well. \n\nI highly recommend Golden Jade.\nRead more\nWritten March 16, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
