            "review_text": "spktravels\nTallman, New York360 contributions\n0\nSurprisingly good\nDec 2019 • Couples\nThe reason for only a 4 is because on a Christmas Eve the restaurant was packed and overly noisy. It is in the SC Vivo mall and from appearances it looks closer to fast food as opposed to fine dining \n\nWith that being said the food was delicious and well presented. We had stir fried eggplant and soft shelled crab. Both dishes were very tasty. After finishing these dishes a man came wheeling a cart containing egg tarts. We ordered them and once again they were as good as any that we had in Hong Kong. \n \nSeveral times our wait staff replaced my pot of tea without me having to ask. \n\nA nice dinner that I recommend.\nRead more\nWritten December 25, 2019",
