            "review_text": "desiremmwekb10\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam2964 contributions\n0\nGreat Dim Sum for the weekend\nJul 2019 • Family\nWe like to come here for dim sum on Sunday. The food is great. Peking duck 2 dishes for 680k VND is such a great deal. Love the crispy fatty skin of the duck as well as the duck stir fried noodle. Xiaolong bao is another great dim sum dish. Order it every time. Service is quick. Nice ambience. Recommend for family dim sum in the weekend.\nWritten July 22, 2019",
